    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Spell Resistance"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A formian mageslayer takes 15 fewer damage from any arcane or primal spell that causes damage, and 10 less damage from any divine or occult spell that causes damage."
            },
            "id": "07efe497-5c48-472a-a305-9447d47e3a4e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:14.471514"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Disrupting Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, aura, primal)\n\n30 feet. Formian mageslayers are surrounded by an aura of disruptive energy that disperses magical energy and makes spellcasting difficult for their enemies. Whenever an enemy creature within the aura attempts to Cast a Spell or Activate a magic item, they must roll a DC 5 flat check; on a failed check, the spell or activation is lost and the action is wasted. Free action activations disrupted by this aura can't be attempted again until the start of the activating creature's next turn."
            },
            "id": "47a5ff56-b2a7-435f-b532-5ce14f47dfe8",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:14.471514"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Hive Mind"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divination, primal)\n\nAs formian worker."
            },
            "id": "8e0d4701-359b-4e31-8bcb-a1c0f08ce731",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:14.471514"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stupefying Touch"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, curse, primal)\n\nA creature damaged by a mageslayer's claw Strike must succeed at a 37 Will save. The creature becomes stupefied 2 for 1 round on a failure. On a critical failure, the creature is stupefied 2 for 1 hour."
            },
            "id": "a3e03ed7-2554-41cf-900c-9d7ff4578fde",
