      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Shred Spell"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, primal)\n\nTrigger: A creature within the formian mageslayer's disrupting aura that the formian mageslayer can see succeeds at a DC 5 flat check to Cast the Spell in the aura\n\nThe mageslayer attempts to unravel the spell's magic and attempts to counteract the spell. They use their Arcana modifier as their counteract modifier with a counteract level of 8. If the formian mageslayer succeeds, they counter the spell and use the dispersed energy to gain a number of temporary Hit Points equal to twice the spell's level for 1 minute. If the formian mageslayer critically fails this counteract check, their disrupting aura deactivates for 1 minute."
            },
